{"flow": "non-implementation-review", "desc": "规则与文档例外: 改动审核系统本身 (Reviewer 角色, 关卡语义) 或长期规范合同条款时, 由一个 requirements-reviewer 审一轮, 作者处理问题后提交, 不复审.", "entry": "scope", "returns": {"pass": "无需审核或已处理完, 可以提交", "restage": "作者改了文件, 重新暂存", "stopped": "用户停止"}}
{"id": "scope", "type": "program", "desc": "路径命中审核系统或规范目录即需要审核; 有规则文档但未命中时交判断模型.", "primitive": "commit.nonImplementationReviewScope", "args": {"reviewSystemGlobs": "$param.reviewSystemGlobs"}, "next": {"review-required": "freeze", "maybe": "judge", "none": "return:pass"}, "src": ["skills/commit/non-implementation-workflow.md#5"]}
{"id": "judge", "type": "judgment", "desc": "单向题: 拿不准按需要审核.", "next": {"yes": "freeze", "no": "return:pass"}, "kind": "choice", "category": "scope", "oneWay": true, "conservative": "yes", "template": "下面的规则与文档改动是否改变审核系统本身 (Reviewer 角色, 关卡语义) 或长期规范的合同条款?", "state": ["$state.stagedDiff.ruleDocs"], "options": ["yes", "no"], "src": ["skills/commit/non-implementation-workflow.md#5"]}
{"id": "freeze", "type": "program", "desc": "固定受审的比较.", "primitive": "review.freezeComparison", "args": {}, "next": {"frozen": "review"}, "barrier": true, "src": ["skills/commit/non-implementation-workflow.md#5"]}
{"id": "review", "type": "agent", "desc": "正式关卡; 等待超过 30 分钟提醒用户, 不中断.", "work": "review:requirements", "next": {"no-problems": "return:pass", "problems": "dispose", "incomplete": "ask-incomplete"}, "formalGate": true, "write": {"scope": "report-only"}, "instruction": "按所附 Role 文档与 Reviewer 通用规则, 审核本次冻结的非实施比较 (无授权 issue). 只此一轮, 不复审.", "inputs": ["$result.freeze", "doc:docs/agents/roles/requirements-reviewer.md", "doc:docs/agents/reviewer.md"], "output": {"branch": ["no-problems", "problems", "incomplete"], "fields": {"report": "path", "reason": "string?"}}, "timeBudget": {"notifyUserAfterMin": 30, "repeatMin": 15, "interrupt": false}, "src": ["skills/commit/non-implementation-workflow.md#5", "skills/reviewer-launch/SKILL.md#15"]}
{"id": "ask-incomplete", "type": "waitUser", "desc": "`incomplete` 不是审核结果.", "next": {"retry": "freeze", "stop": "return:stopped"}, "question": "Reviewer 未能完成审核, 原因见背景. 处理原因后重试, 或停止.", "options": ["retry", "stop"], "context": ["$output.review.reason"], "src": ["skills/commit/SKILL.md#7"]}
{"id": "dispose", "type": "agent", "desc": "作者处置审核问题.", "work": "author", "next": {"fixed": "mark", "no-change": "return:pass", "ask-user:stop": "return:stopped"}, "write": {"scope": "instance"}, "instruction": "逐条核对 Reviewer 报告中问题引用的证据和推理, 它只是信息, 不是证明. 成立的问题在本次修正; 认为无效的写明证据. 本次改动既未引入也未影响的既有缺口不阻断提交, 写成后续 issue 草稿交给用户. 修正后不再复审.", "inputs": ["$output.review.report"], "output": {"branch": ["fixed", "no-change", "ask-user"], "fields": {"commitMessage": "string?", "question": "string?"}}, "src": ["skills/commit/non-implementation-workflow.md#5", "baseline/docs/agents/subagent-findings.md#1", "baseline/docs/agents/subagent-findings.md#15", "baseline/docs/agents/subagent-findings.md#16", "baseline/docs/agents/subagent-findings.md#17"]}
